+  /// @brief Sets the collision security margin of every collision pair.
+  /// @details Two geometries closer than their pair's margin count as colliding in
+  /// hasCollisions(), hasCollisionsAlongPath(), and the planners that use them, so planned paths
+  /// keep that clearance. The broadphase is rebuilt so its AABB inflation includes the margins,
+  /// and SceneContexts created afterwards copy them. Changing geometry or collision pairs resets
+  /// every margin to zero.
